---
title: "C30 — Selected-candidate promotion · Planned"
---
flowchart TD
  Release[Pinned selected app manifests and ECR digests] -. apply selected services .-> Dev[dev acceptance]
  Dev -. same selected digests .-> QA[qa acceptance]
  QA -. same digests and approval .-> Stage[stage acceptance]
  Stage -. same digests and approval .-> Prod[prod acceptance]
  Config[Inject each target's runtime settings] -.-> Dev
  Config -.-> QA
  Config -.-> Stage
  Config -.-> Prod
  Keep[Retain unselected services in every target] -.-> Dev
  Keep -.-> Prod
  Skip[Skip a service already at desired digest and config] -. idempotent apply .-> QA
  Dev -. fail .-> Stop[Stop advancement]
  QA -. fail .-> Stop
  Stage -. fail .-> Stop
  NewMain[New main creates a separate candidate] -. never replace selected candidate .-> Release
  Previous[Known compatible selected images and config] -. explicit rollback .-> Prod
  Schema[Check API, event and database compatibility] -. before each promotion .-> Release
